  <name>Kolori</name>
  <summary>Create beautiful pieces of art using mathematical expressions</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Kolori is an application that uses domain coloring to generate beautiful, colorful portraits from a mathematical expression.
    </p>
    <p>
      Input a mathematical expression, and create an image or video generated from  We support every trigonometric function plus advanced ones such as the gamma, mod, floor, ceil, trunc, and frac functions.
    </p>
    <p>
      The only thing that limits you, is your imagination.
    </p>
  </description>

